title: RTC_Manager_Task
---

flowchart TD
    A[RTC manager task runs] --> B[Detect RTC screen changes]
    B --> C[Bind UI event handlers when screen is new]
    C --> D{RTC screen currently active?}
    D -- No --> E[return]
    D -- Yes --> F{Editing mode active?}
    F -- Yes --> G[Show editable RTC time]
    F -- No --> H[Read current RTC time]
    H --> I[Show current RTC time]
    G --> J[return]
    I --> J
